{"resource":{"id":"rust-pdf-notes","title":"Rust — PDF Notes","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"69 min","pages":92,"lastUpdated":"January 2026","tags":["Programming","Rust","Systems"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"Chapter-wise handbook covering ownership, lifetimes, Cargo, modules, collections, traits, generics, smart pointers, concurrency, async, and deployment."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"c1","label":"Ch 1 — Ecosystem & Setup"},{"id":"c2","label":"Ch 2 — Syntax Essentials"},{"id":"c3","label":"Ch 3 — Ownership"},{"id":"c4","label":"Ch 4 — Borrowing"},{"id":"c5","label":"Ch 5 — Lifetimes"},{"id":"c6","label":"Ch 6 — Structs & Enums"},{"id":"c7","label":"Ch 7 — Cargo & Modules"},{"id":"c8","label":"Ch 8 — Collections"},{"id":"c9","label":"Ch 9 — Traits"},{"id":"c10","label":"Ch 10 — Generics"},{"id":"c11","label":"Ch 11 — Smart Pointers"},{"id":"c12","label":"Ch 12 — Error Handling"},{"id":"c13","label":"Ch 13 — Testing"},{"id":"c14","label":"Ch 14 — Concurrency"},{"id":"c15","label":"Ch 15 — Async Programming"},{"id":"c16","label":"Ch 16 — Networking"},{"id":"c17","label":"Ch 17 — Deployment"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Rust — Quick Revision Notes","tag":"Programming","time":"9 min"},{"title":"Rust — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Programming","time":"5 min"},{"title":"Rust — Complete Tutorial","tag":"Programming","time":"41 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Have a printable, chapter-wise Rust handbook for offline study.</li>\n          <li>Move from beginner to advanced with continuous references.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Format</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Optimised for print and offline reading — headings, key points, and one code sample per section.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 1 — Ecosystem &amp; Setup</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>rustup</code> manages toolchains; <code>cargo</code> handles projects; <code>rustc</code> compiles; <code>clippy</code> lints; <code>rustfmt</code> formats.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Rust toolchain: rustup → rustc/cargo/clippy/rustfmt.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 2 — Syntax Essentials</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>let x = 10;\nlet mut y: f64 = 3.14;\nif x &gt; 0 { println!(&quot;+&quot;); }\nfor i in 0..3 { println!(&quot;{i}&quot;); }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 3 — Ownership</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Single owner, move on assignment, drop at scope end. Copy types are exceptions.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 4 — Borrowing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Shared (<code>&amp;</code>) or exclusive (<code>&amp;mut</code>). Aliasing XOR mutation.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 5 — Lifetimes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Named regions of code where a reference is valid. Elision covers most cases; annotate when required.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 6 — Structs &amp; Enums</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>struct Point { x: f64, y: f64 }\nenum Op { Add, Sub, Mul, Div }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 7 — Cargo &amp; Modules</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>Cargo.toml</code> declares deps; <code>mod</code> declares modules; <code>pub</code> exports items.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 8 — Collections</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>Vec</code>, <code>String</code>, <code>HashMap</code>, <code>HashSet</code>, <code>BTreeMap</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 9 — Traits</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Contract of behaviour. Auto-derives: <code>Debug</code>, <code>Clone</code>, <code>PartialEq</code>, <code>Default</code>, <code>Hash</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 10 — Generics</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Compile-time monomorphized. Use where-clauses to keep signatures readable.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c11\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 11 — Smart Pointers</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>Box</code>, <code>Rc</code>, <code>Arc</code>, <code>RefCell</code>, <code>Cell</code>, <code>Mutex</code>, <code>RwLock</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c12\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 12 — Error Handling</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>Result</code>, <code>?</code>, <code>thiserror</code> (libraries), <code>anyhow</code> (applications).</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c13\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 13 — Testing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Unit (<code>#[cfg(test)]</code>), integration (<code>tests/</code>), doctests, property-based (<code>proptest</code>).</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c14\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 14 — Concurrency</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Threads, <code>Arc&lt;Mutex&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code>, channels, rayon for data parallelism.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544197150-b99a580bb7a8?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Concurrency primitives: threads, channels, and shared-state via Arc+Mutex.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c15\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 15 — Async Programming</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Zero-cost futures, tokio runtime, <code>async fn</code> + <code>.await</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c16\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 16 — Networking</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>tokio TCP/UDP, <code>reqwest</code> for HTTP, Axum/Actix for servers.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c17\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Ch 17 — Deployment</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Static binaries (<code>musl</code>), distroless containers, cross-compilation with <code>cross</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Read a chapter, code a small example, then move on. Return every few weeks to reinforce.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Best for offline study?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Print in landscape, two columns.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Elision</strong> — compiler inferring lifetimes.</li>\n          <li><strong>Monomorphization</strong> — generating specialized code per generic instantiation.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Educational notes — pair with hands-on practice.</p>\n      </div></section>"}